flowchart LR
    subgraph UNTRUSTED[Untrusted browser]
      Client[Browser UI / QA probes]
    end
    subgraph TRUST[Trusted backend boundary]
      API[Node HTTP API]
      AuthN[AuthN: password + session validation]
      AuthZ[AuthZ: server-side role policy]
      Store[(Local demo storage)]
    end
    Client -->|POST login / register| API
    Client -->|HttpOnly session cookie| API
    API --> AuthN
    AuthN -->|Identity verified| AuthZ
    AuthN -->|No valid session: 401| Client
    AuthZ -->|User to admin endpoint: 403| Client
    AuthZ -->|Admin allowed: 200| Store
    Store -->|Sanitized user records| API
    API -->|200 response| Client
